ure Double Chow\" patterns\n- The concealed B1 Pung adds value\n- East Wind Pung already scored\n\nReason: B8 is an isolated tile that cannot form any melds with my current hand structure. The Bamboo suit tiles (T4-T8) form a strong\u9023\u7d9a (connected) structure with multiple potential chows, and the B1 Pung is valuable. Discarding B8 maintains maximum flexibility while eliminating a dead tile with only 1 copy remaining unshown.\n\nAnswer: Play B8"}
